{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"61377a83740b2f243e834523f4f7946279a981ca1ef2b7e68d2a6cd11c56232a","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"219be9e3f82597cfa40545f046e92daa40fa906d9f2560b715120658b922dc91","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"末句漏掉限定词 unique：源文（tome-ashes-urhrok/data/talents/corruptions/demonic-pact.lua 第700行，来源未固定，文件 sha256 5fc8f608…）为 \"Implanting a seed into unique demons, if successful, will always try to grant a seed of that type\"，只适用于独特（unique）恶魔；译文「如果成功将种子植入恶魔体内，总会尝试给予与该恶魔同类型的种子」把适用范围扩大到所有恶魔，改变了机制描述。建议补回「独特」限定，并与本条 Unique 等级的译法保持一致。"},{"revision_key":"913d7afe257f0845eb5028d81a9d4ec7853f2009c25f5b302837ec4ed73efbe4","verdict":"OK"}]}